# Author: Muhammad Mohsin Khan
# Created: 28.10.2026
# ==========================================================
# CalculiX GraphiX (cgx) FBD script
# Unit system: mm, s, N, tonne
#
# Rectangular tensile bar: 100 x 10 x 10 mm
# Cross-section in the YZ plane, swept along X
#
# Fixed end: x = 0 mm. Free/load end: x = 100 mm.
# Reference end displacement for the CCX input deck: 0.5 mm
#
# Mesh: linear hexahedral (HE8/C3D8),
#
# Run from a writable working directory:
#   cgx -b plastic_bar.fbd
#
# The script exports the mesh and named node sets. Depending on the CGX
# version, the Abaqus-format mesh/set files are written using the set names.
# ==========================================================

pnt p1 0 0 0
pnt p2 0 10 0
pnt p3 0 10 10
pnt p4 0 0 10

line l1 p1 p2 4
line l2 p2 p3 4
line l3 p3 p4 4
line l4 p4 p1 4

gsur s1 + BLEND + l1 + l2 + l3 + l4

# Original and translated end faces
seta left s s1
swep left right tra 100 0 0 40

# Linear hexahedral elements
elty all he8
mesh all

# Export mesh
send all abq

# Complete the end-face sets down to their mesh entities
comp left do
comp right do

# Export node sets
send left abq nam
send right abq nam

# Display mesh
plot e all